        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ransom Riggs, John Berry\n- Products: Miss Peregrine's Home for Peculiar Children, Hollow City\n- Roles: writer, filmmaker, film director\n- Concepts: Hollywood blacklist\n\nFacts:\n- John Berry was born on September 6, 1917, and he was an American film director.\n- Ransom Riggs was born on February 3, 1979, and he is an American writer and filmmaker.\n- Hollow City is a 2014 dark fantasy novel written by Ransom Riggs.\n- Hollow City is a sequel to Miss Peregrine's Home for Peculiar Children.\n- Ransom Riggs is best known for the book Miss Peregrine's Home for Peculiar Children.\n- John Berry went into self-exile in France after the Hollywood blacklist interrupted his career.\n- John Berry died on November 29, 1999.",
